OL,5,G1100 Church Going, with Giles Fraser
OL,6,     FGiles Fraser is a priest in the
OL,7,     FChurch of England anxious about
OL,8,     Fdeclining numbers. He talks to
OL,9,     Fexperts and returns to his
OL,10,     Fparishes from the past to work out
OL,11,     Fwhere we are.
