OL,5,G1345 Dead Rabbit
OL,6,     F6/11. Dan and Lucy find a video
OL,7,     Ffrom the night of the cup,
OL,8,     Fexposing that hare coursing isn't
OL,9,     Fjust a game - it's big business.
OL,10,     FWhy would anyone pay tens of
OL,11,     Fthousands of pounds for a dog?
OL,12,G1400 The Archers
OL,13,     FJolene is left devastated, and
OL,14,     FChris attempts a recruitment.
OL,15,G1415 Alone
OL,16,     F3/6. After encouragement from
OL,17,     FMorris, a cat moves in to the
OL,18,     Fhouse. Everyone loves the
OL,19,     Fnewcomer, save for Louisa, who
OL,20,     Fdoesn't want distractions from her
OL,21,     Fwork. Stars Angus Deayton.
